Access Control Challenge - Solution Walkthrough
Vulnerability Analysis

The contract has a critical vulnerability in the changeOwner function:
solidity

function changeOwner(address _newOwner) public {
    address oldOwner = owner;
    owner = _newOwner;
    emit OwnerChanged(oldOwner, _newOwner);
}

Issue: There is no access control modifier (like require(msg.sender == owner)) to restrict who can call this function. Anyone can become the owner by simply calling this function with their own address.
